  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 180 °C and line a baking sheet with lightly oiled parchment.",
    "Pulse the pistachios into fine crumbs (big pieces make the dough fragile).",
    "Mix all the ingredients except the jam, first with a spoon, then squeeze together by hand into a sticky dough.",
    "Roll 12 equal balls (about 1½ tbsp each) with oiled hands and space them on the sheet.",
    "Press a deep hollow in each with the oiled back of a ½-tsp measure and fill with ½ tsp jam.",
    "Bake 12–14 minutes until the sides are lightly golden. Cool 10 minutes, top up the jam if needed, then move to a rack."
  ],
